WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Before the neighborhood wakes, the riverside path is quiet.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.500
Two friends meet near the old bridge and take the long way through the trees.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
They stop at a small cafe for coffee, then ride home in the warm morning light.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.400
They are not training for anything.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.900
The point is to get outside, share a little time, and start the day at an easier pace.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.885
On weekends, this short route feels like a small reset: familiar streets, no schedule, and one good conversation before everything gets busy.
